WEBVTT

00:00:26.106 --> 00:00:30.084
And then what are the consequences
in terms of the wreckage,

00:00:30.108 --> 00:00:31.442
when you look at it?

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:38.516
And I think you have to think of that
as incomes and balance sheets,

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.757
you know?

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.610
So it was a tremendous income hit.

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:46.510
And then the balance sheets losses.

00:00:46.815 --> 00:00:49.987
And who has what savings and so on.

00:00:50.609 --> 00:00:53.569
And then how is that dealt with.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.102
In order to understand that,

00:00:56.126 --> 00:00:58.950
you have to realize
that there are these holes.

00:00:58.974 --> 00:01:01.188
These holes in income,